<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:35.45pt'><a
name=madde40></a><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span style='font-size:
11.0pt'>Teminatın/verginin iadesi<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt'><i><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow'>Tasarruflu Yazılar</span></i><span
